TrimmingValueP|OffSet Trimming Value (PMOS)|Basic Parameters||0|31|
TrimmingValueN|OffSet Trimming Value (NMOS)|Basic Parameters||0|31|
TrimmingValuePHighSpeed|OffSet Trimming Value in High Speed Mode (PMOS)|Basic Parameters||0|31|
TrimmingValueNHighSpeed|OffSet Trimming Value in High Speed Mode (NMOS)|Basic Parameters||0|31|
Mode|Mode|Basic Parameters||||
PgaConnect|PGA Inverting Pin|Basic Parameters||||
PgaGain|PGA Gain|Basic Parameters||||

