UserTrimming|OPAMP_TRIMMING_FACTORY|Disable
Mode|OPAMP_STANDALONE_MODE|Standalone
Mode|OPAMP_FOLLOWER_MODE|Follower
Mode|OPAMP_PGA_MODE|Pga
PgaConnect|OPAMP_PGA_CONNECT_INVERTINGINPUT_NO|Not Connected
PgaConnect|OPAMP_PGA_CONNECT_INVERTINGINPUT_IO0|Connected To VM0
PgaConnect|OPAMP_PGA_CONNECT_INVERTINGINPUT_IO0_BIAS|Connected To VM0
